description	"Tusken Raider Chieftain

Chief of the Sand people, access to special weapons and a master of instructing ambushes.  

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- Lightweight
- Chieftain Gaffi Stick (Staff/Red Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- BP Free Jumps
-- Lightweight
-- 100% more special damage
-- 30% longer
-- 25% more knockback
-- 7% less AS
- Sand Shrapnel Canister (3)
-- Conc Grenade, Blinds/Slips/Stun/Cripples, 
-- Low Damage
- Thermal Grenade (3)

^8Attributes:
- Tusken Fury (3)
-- 99% slower decay
- Getup (2)
- Knockdown Roll
- Tracking Beacon
- Stat Viewer
- Rally
- Melee Resist
- Dexterity (1)
- Tusken Strength (1)
- Healing (1)

^8Abilities:
- Krayt Dragon Venom Darts (Tracking Darts 6 ^3[CS4])
- Combat Roll ^3[CS3]
- Shoulder Barge ^3[CS2]
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- Instruct (Force/Block Dispenser 3) ^3[USE In Melee]"